00:00:38.071 --> 00:00:39.572
if each of us, each partner

00:00:39.572 --> 00:00:41.274
and us in our country,

00:00:41.274 --> 00:00:43.009
if we stay, is one strong fist

00:00:43.009 --> 00:00:44.577
and if our partners are united

00:00:44.577 --> 00:00:45.779
for our victory,

00:00:45.779 --> 00:00:47.947
because this is a victory of values.

00:00:47.947 --> 00:00:49.716
If they stick to all their words

00:00:49.716 --> 00:00:50.617
to all their terms

00:00:50.617 --> 00:00:52.519
and it's not just blah, blah, blah,

00:00:52.519 --> 00:00:54.154
I believe in it.

00:00:54.154 --> 00:00:55.488
We have been strong partners

00:00:55.488 --> 00:00:57.257
