00:01:02.495 --> 00:01:04.230
I am certain there will be victory.

00:01:04.230 --> 00:01:06.266
I don't think I know it will happen

00:01:06.266 --> 00:01:07.033
this year.

00:01:07.100 --> 00:01:08.401
