00:01:27.687 --> 00:01:29.222
it is several countries in the world

00:01:29.222 --> 00:01:30.924
Ukraine is not alone.

00:01:30.924 --> 00:01:31.491
We are help

00:01:31.491 --> 00:01:33.693
our friends for our shared values

00:01:33.693 --> 00:01:35.161
so that this war doesn't spread,

00:01:35.161 --> 00:01:37.564
so that this aggression doesn't spread.

00:01:37.564 --> 00:01:39.165
